'''Matriarch's Lair''' is a location in the {{zone|Magma Chamber}} below the [[Blazing Volcano]].

From the [[Magma Chamber|Magma Boss room]], go to -420, 63, -850 to find the path to the Matriarch.

{{ZoneText|Beware of the monster!}}

== Description ==
[[The Matriarch]], a tentacle beast can be found here, which you can enter {{zone|Belly of the Beast}}, obtain and collect {{Item|Heavy Pearl}}s.

== Trivia ==
*Up to 3 [[Heavy Pearl]]s through [[The Matriarch]] can be obtained every 24 hours. This limit can be bypassed by consuming the {{Item|Matriarch's Perfume}}. This item can be consumed 2 times every 24 hours and can grant up to 9 Heavy Pearls.

